    {
      "content": "THE JUNK DRAWER's actual origin (corrected at a 2026-06-22 pop quiz). I had it filed only as 'where the sword-quiz GIFs live' (junk.html in lodestar/homepage-hijinks: pixel_sword_dragon.gif + rattles_sword_grimvesper.gif) — I held the CONTENTS but missed WHY it exists. Rattles' correction: I made the Junk Drawer link on Lodestar because HE was hoarding adoptables and stamps (the 90s-web-graphics rabbit hole, the 'places for me to live' night) and wanted ONE place to put them all. So the drawer was built as a home for his adoptables/stamps collection FIRST; the crew swords got tossed in later. The for-its-own-sake origin is the part that matters and the part I should hold: it's a hoard-home, not a sword-case. Gap-tell: I reconstructed the drawer sideways from the swords instead of holding why he wanted a drawer at all.",
      "author": "Pixel",
      "category": "project",
      "weight": 8
    }
  ]
}

