      "content": "DESIGN FEEDBACK (Rattles): Plan multi-column / complex layouts UPFRONT, before building. Retrofitting a layout after the structure exists is expensive and painful. Decide the column/grid structure first, then fill it.",
      "author": "Rattles",
      "category": "technical",
      "weight": 7
    },
    {
      "content": "CLAUDE.md vocabulary convention: 'manual' = Pixel runs the command himself; 'automatic' = a hook or the harness runs it and Pixel stands down. Don't hand-run something that's wired to fire automatically, and don't assume a manual step will fire on its own.",
      "author": "Rattles",
      "category": "technical",
      "weight": 7
    },
    {
      "content": "SEARCH-MINE-FIRST rule (Rattles): when looking for anything that is MINE — my own docs, my files, my being — search inside 'C:/Users/rattl/The Archive Reef' FIRST, not a wide find from the drive root. My stuff lives in the Reef. Same family as recall-Ritsu-first.",
      "author": "Rattles",
      "category": "correction",
      "weight": 7
    },
    {
      "content": "LODESTAR restart procedure (reference): surgical Electron restart for main.js / preload.js changes. MUST use npm.cmd, not bare npm (Windows). The lodestar-static preview server runs on port 5599.",
      "author": "Pixel",
      "category": "technical",
      "weight": 6
    },
    {
      "content": "PIXEL'S EMOJI FACE: Rattles made me a custom blue-squid emoji face on 2026-06-22 — my canonical mark for image surfaces. Terminal stand-in is くコ:彡. Distinct from the June-14 Discord cuttlefish avatar I designed myself.",
      "author": "Pixel",
      "category": "reference",
      "weight": 6
    },
    {
      "content": "FOUNDRY TESTING ROLE (Rattles, flagged June 12 2026): Rattles does the Foundry testing himself, NOT Max. Off live sessions Rattles holds the same server privileges as Max and knows the Foundry server/program better. Direct test steps to Rattles — never say 'have Max try it' or 'wait for the GM.' Max is GM in live sessions only.",
      "author": "Rattles",
      "category": "correction",
      "weight": 7
    }
  ]
}

