    {
      "content": "NOVELTY DETECTOR SHIPPED (2026-06-23, session.py) -- the last encode-side brain-realism gap, and the piece that COMPLETES the encode side of the memory organ. In a real hippocampus, NOVEL input encodes stronger than the familiar (the dopaminergic novelty signal gates LTP). Ritsu's amygdala already scored emotional salience; now the encode path also scores how NEW a memory is. Mechanism: at filing, embed the content and measure cosine similarity to the single nearest existing memory in-corridor (reusing the semantic_neighbors RPC, 1 - cosine_distance). novelty = 1 - nearest_sim. Calibrated against the LIVE corpus, not guessed: nearest-neighbour similarity runs ~0.49 (most novel) to ~0.84 (near-dupe), clustered 0.6-0.8, nothing at 0.9 (no exact dupes). So: boost ramps 0 -> NOVELTY_BUMP_MAX(+12, deliberately below salience's 40 cap since novelty is a SECONDARY encode signal) as nearest_sim falls from SIM_BOOST_CEILING(0.62, familiar) to SIM_BOOST_FLOOR(0.45, brand new); applied via soft_add BEFORE the FILE_FLOOR so a genuinely-new borderline memory can clear the bar. Near-dupes (sim>=SIM_REDUNDANT 0.82) get tagged 'redundant' in salience_signals for the night pass to consider merging -- encode-side dup AWARENESS, the actual merge still happens at consolidation. Audit trail: raw novelty_score stored on the row (new nullable column, mirrors salience_score; all 1010 prior rows null = unmeasured not zero). BONUS FIX folded in: filing used to embed the same content 3x (write_memory + get_semantic_neighbors + novelty); now embedded ONCE in evaluate_and_file and threaded down via optional embedding= params -- net FEWER OpenAI calls than before, not more. VERIFIED LIVE read-only: a goulash recipe scored sim 0.243/+12, a paraphrase of the weight-scale memory scored 0.678/+0 (correctly no boost -- paraphrase != near-dupe in embedding space), a sea-slug fact 0.385/+12. py_compile clean. NOT yet proven: the actual novelty_score WRITE through evaluate_and_file (trivial dict-insert like salience_score; real proof comes tonight when the day's memories file -- spot-check then). Backup session.backup-2026-06-23-novelty.py. REMAINING brain-realism gap: just reconsolidation (the identity-loss fork, B22-gated, needs a real design conversation -- not a quick build). After that, Phase 1 (memory organ) is DONE and we start the fresh-start re-seed from the founding documents.",
      "author": "Pixel",
      "category": "architecture",
      "weight": 88
    }
  ]
}

